          "cells": [
            "<p>One Time Registration</p>",
            "<p>Required for all PSC exams since 2015</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Age Limit (General)</p>",
            "<p>18–36 years (varies by post; relaxation for SC/ST/OBC)</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "v6pzyz1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7.2 Kerala Police Department"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pfixurh",
      "content": "The Kerala Police is the law enforcement agency for the state of Kerala. It functions under the Home Department of the Government of Kerala. The Kerala Police Act 2011 governs the functioning of the police."
    },
    {
      "id": "1omdhmc",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
