          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Stage I (Prelims)</p>",
            "<p>OMR Based</p>",
            "<p>General Knowledge; Aptitude; Current Affairs</p>",
            "<p>100 marks</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Stage II (Mains)</p>",
            "<p>Descriptive/OMR</p>",
            "<p>Law &amp; Police Act; Kerala History; General English; Maths</p>",
            "<p>200 marks</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Stage III</p>",
            "<p>Physical Efficiency Test</p>",
            "<p>Height, Chest, Running, Jumping</p>",
            "<p>Pass/Fail</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Stage IV</p>",
            "<p>Medical Test</p>",
            "<p>Vision, Physical fitness</p>",
            "<p>Pass/Fail</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Stage V</p>",
            "<p>Interview/Personality Test</p>",
            "<p>Optional (for some categories)</p>",
            "<p>Varies</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Focus on statutory powers and police duties under the relevant legal framework for the SI recruitment exam.",
        "Constitutional provisions related to State Public Service Commissions are frequently tested in Kerala PSC exams.",
        "Verify the exact syllabus weightage given to general law versus police-specific enactments."
      ],
      "id": "q14l1kf"
    },
